  "bodyHash": "QNsysY+b6VQ=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">突變怪物（Mutant Monsters）將 Minecraft 的生物推向了恐怖的新高度！與經典生物的突變版本戰鬥，每種都擁有毀滅性的力量與獨特獎勵。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擊敗突變殭屍、突變骷髏、突變苦力怕、突變終界使者等，每場戰鬥都帶來全新挑戰。製作強力物品、馴服爆炸性僕從，並發現如蜘蛛豬等奇異新生物。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在生存不會受保證的世界中，準備好迎接史詩級戰鬥與傳奇戰利品！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 突變生物精選</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧟‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">突變殭屍</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：擁有強力重擊的魁梧蠻力。擊敗它可獲得強大的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">浩克之錘</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">突變骷髏</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：致命的射手。擊敗它可用其骨頭製作</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">突變骷髏盔甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">突變苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：以連鎖爆炸造成混亂。死亡時掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕僕從蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">突變終界使者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：能瞬間移動的恐怖存在。切斷其手可獲得</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終界靈魂之手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以掌握其力量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">☃️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">突變雪人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：強大的盟友，會向敵人投擲巨大冰塊。</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">👾 僕從與夥伴</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕僕從</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：從</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕僕從蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">孵化的爆炸性盟友。可使用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕僕從追蹤器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">進行馴服與追蹤。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕷️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蜘蛛豬</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一種快速且難以預測的生物，可由吃了發酵蜘蛛眼的豬經</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">化學X</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">創造而成。</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 特殊物品</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">化學X</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一種能將生物突變成強大變異體或奇異新生物的謎樣液體。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">浩克之錘</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：能猛擊地面、擊退敵人的強力武器。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終界靈魂之手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：從突變終界使者獲得傳送與方塊操作能力。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕碎片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一種有毒武器，用於地形時會引發爆炸。可破壞</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕僕從蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">獲得。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕僕從追蹤器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：用於追蹤與控制苦力怕僕從的裝置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">突變骷髏盔甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：使用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">突變骷髏骨頭</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">製作的強力盔甲。</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客戶端與伺服器端皆需安裝</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援，可直接在遊戲內透過模組選單進行設定（需安裝</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（作者：</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）在 Fabric 上使用）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，也需安裝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有檔案皆位於</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，並根據設定類型命名為</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。並非所有類型都會存在於模組中，或可能完全不存在任何設定檔。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衷心感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Shcott21</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，他在多年前以</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-creatures-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mutant Creatures</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 為名首發了此模組。絕大部分的工作，尤其是那些驚人的模型，皆由他一手完成。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chumbanotz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Chumbanotz</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，他是首位將這些突變生物以</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mutant Beasts</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組帶入現代 Minecraft 的人，為本次最終重製奠定了基礎。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">非常感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tdstress\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">tdstress</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，他徹底翻新了模組中的所有紋理，使其符合新的 Minecraft 美術風格！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bag-of-holding\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ytones\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/ytones/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-chested\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
